        rdfs:label "Odell, Oster, Alberch & Burnside (1981) / Martin, Kaschube & Wieschaus (2009) stretch-activated apical purse-string constriction and ventral furrow invagination — Morphological realism / specimen match: 89/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Segments all 4 transverse confocal stages in Panel B of `drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg` (DAPI blue nuclei, Neurotactin green membranes, Myosin II red apical cortex), capturing the monotonic dorsoventral compression (DV/ML = 1.0504 -> 1.0294 -> 0.9621 -> 0.9217, Delta_h = 42.0 px, 14.58% mesoderm area internalization) and achieving r = 0.9942 (p = 5.79e-3) against the delay-coupled buckling trajectory." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
